ArchiveEntry "Level C minor M1 > 0 on Routh (sub-lemma of theorem_levelC_polynomial)"

/*
 * Decomposition of theorem_levelC_polynomial (monolithic M1&M2&M3 QE times out).
 * Sub-lemma 1/3: the first leading principal minor M1 = P00 of P_poly is
 * positive on the Routh region (D1>b, K>D1*b). Pure parametric QE.
 */

ProgramVariables
  Real D1;
  Real b;
  Real K;
End.

Problem
  \forall D1 \forall b \forall K (
    ( D1 > 0 & b > 0 & K > 0 & D1 > b & K > D1*b )
    ->
    D1^2*K^2+D1^2*K+D1^2*b^2-D1*K*b+2*K^3+K^2*b^2+2*K^2+K*b^2 > 0
  )
End.

Tactic "Proof"
  QE
End.

End.
